### GR Receipt API samples
@host = https://localhost:5001
@owner = 0c250000-50bf-11e7-89e2-1cbdb9e7fd04

### List receipts
GET {{host}}/api/gr/receipts?page=1&pageSize=20
X-Owner-Id: {{owner}}
X-User-Id: tester

### Create receipt
POST {{host}}/api/gr/receipts
X-Owner-Id: {{owner}}
X-User-Id: tester
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-26",
  "paymentMode": "Cash",
  "receiptType": "Regular",
  "receivedBy": "Cashier",
  "customer": {
    "name": "Parent A",
    "contact": "9876543210",
    "studyingIn": "I",
    "section": "A",
    "customerType": "Student"
  },
  "orderItems": [
    { "particular": "Tuition", "amount": 1500, "extras": { "term": "1" } }
  ]
}

### Get by id
GET {{host}}/api/gr/receipts/{{receiptId}}
X-Owner-Id: {{owner}}

### Print
POST {{host}}/api/gr/receipts/{{receiptId}}/print
X-Owner-Id: {{owner}}

### Cancel
POST {{host}}/api/gr/receipts/{{receiptId}}/cancel
X-Owner-Id: {{owner}}

### Report summary
POST {{host}}/api/gr/reports/summary
X-Owner-Id: {{owner}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "2026-09-01",
  "to": "2026-10-31",
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 50
}
